  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Never Again Rwanda 2022-2025 - Never Again Rwanda 2022-25</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Never Again Rwanda 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Never Again Rwanda (NAR) mellan juli 2022 och december 2025. St&#xf6;det riktas till genomf&#xf6;randet av NAR&apos;s strategiska plan 2022-24 Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att (1) bidra till NAR&apos;s strategim&#xe5;l att engagera det rwandiska samh&#xe4;llet att arbeta f&#xf6;r en h&#xe5;llbar fred och social r&#xe4;ttvisa, att (2) st&#xf6;dja NAR:s organisatoriska utveckling som en demokratisk f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsakt&#xf6;r och utvecklingsakt&#xf6;r i sin egen r&#xe4;tt, samt (3) att bidra till Sidas och ambassadens l&#xe4;rande om direkt st&#xf6;d och k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till lokala civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer.

NAR:s strategiska m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r:
- Att st&#xe4;rka medborgarna med icke-v&#xe5;ldsamma metoder f&#xf6;r att l&#xf6;sa konflikter, bygga upp f&#xf6;rtroende och fr&#xe4;mja traumal&#xe4;kning och f&#xf6;rebyggande av folkmord
- Att fr&#xe4;mja deltagande och inkluderande beslutsprocesser och fr&#xe4;mja r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserade strategier
- Att &#xf6;ka ungdomarnas kapacitet att bli fredsagenter, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra deras f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning, f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka deras och de utsatta befolkningarnas r&#xe4;ttigheter
- Att bygga strategiska partnerskap f&#xf6;r politiskt engagemang och opinionsbildning
&#x2013; Att bli en etablerad tankesmedja genom kvalitetsforskning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is (1) to contribute to NAR&apos;s mission as per its Strategic Plan 2021-25 to engage society to embrace sustainable peace and social justice; (2) to support NAR&apos;s organisational development as a democratic change agent and development actor in its own right, and (3) contribute to the Embassy&apos;s and Sida&apos;s learning on direct and core support to civil society organisations.   

NAR&apos;s strategic objectives are:
- To empower citizens with non-violent means of resolving conflict, build trust and promote trauma healing and genocide prevention  
- To promote participatory and inclusive decision-making processes and advance rights-based approaches
- To increase the capacity of the youth to become peace agents, improve their livelihoods, advocate for their rights and those of the vulnerable populations
- To build strategic partnerships for policy engagement and advocacy 
- To become an established think tank through quality research</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is (1) to contribute to NAR&apos;s mission as per its Strategic Plan 2021-25 to engage society to embrace sustainable peace and social justice; (2) to support NAR&apos;s organisational development as a democratic change agent and development actor in its own right, and (3) contribute to the Embassy&apos;s and Sida&apos;s learning on direct and core support to civil society organisations.   

The objectives under each Strategic Area in turn contribute to NAR&apos;s mission. These objectives are:

- To empower citizens with non-violent means of resolving conflict, build trust and promote trauma healing and genocide prevention  

- To promote participatory and inclusive decision-making processes and advance rights-based approaches

- To increase the capacity of the youth to become peace agents, improve their livelihoods, advocate for their rights and those of the vulnerable populations

- To build strategic partnerships for policy engagement and advocacy 

- To become an established think tank through quality research</narrative>
  </description>
